{"title":"2017 AIME II Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Casework)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Casework)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the number of positive integers less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/5617f6d8def6056c5921630439d64b56cfa519ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2017$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> whose base-three representation contains no digit equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The base-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> representation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/c/64c9d7ac304fb9d30deca642b3cf29ce15555f19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2017_{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/8/c089e99ea5c62bc4fef016d35c75399edfeb8778.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2202201_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" />. Because any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit base-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> number that starts with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d111a5e00ee5ea6700bb629994dc629874c505b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> and has no digit equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> must be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/c/64c9d7ac304fb9d30deca642b3cf29ce15555f19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2017_{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />, all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers that have no digit equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> must start with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25d31faf472ddb4c698a14522fe8125c06f8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Of the base-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers that have no digit equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/7/5b7f45c960c681827d5d03d7b3c30811d3bfd77f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers that start with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25d31faf472ddb4c698a14522fe8125c06f8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/1/a91d92ded08453fe4662a56223d382b4cba6aa35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers that start with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/1/a91d92ded08453fe4662a56223d382b4cba6aa35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/7/5b7f45c960c681827d5d03d7b3c30811d3bfd77f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/0/420813c47b9ba0edd71bba84716bd485967ac81a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^4$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/6/3f6a4ab443c94f13ae3ad0efbc8c6fa07b58a930.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/a/32a35631e1e126934ead6d2af161e9d250827bbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/6/4e68ad31d12ba3d14b80a9341ee44e6238555124.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^1$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers. Summing these up, we find that the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/8/1a81ce0445f88c415cc91247dcd7367d38695add.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^5+2^6+2^6+2^5+2^4+2^3+2^2+2^1=\\boxed{222}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"351\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/1/1c1c4f4e252deb4974ac4b51d4331d22e22910f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2017=2202201_{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"129\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/f/bdf93640dd6b1bc668b0d87cd3c22b167bdde04c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2187=3^7=10000000_{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"179\" height=\"17\" />. There can be a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/e/46e67134b5c5b0595fe7f6a18afe8783d89e2b8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,2,...,7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" /> digit number less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/3/c83e3f84869c291f33c93bd87bc6df516503d67b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2187$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />, and each digit can either be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/6/4e68ad31d12ba3d14b80a9341ee44e6238555124.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^1$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" /> one digit numbers and so on up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/c/afc77519ee6bab163b1aa195a3ba88718d414aa4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digit.\n</p><p><br />\nNow we have to subtract out numbers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/4/1a46b5b3929665fcb2500f3583ab77297a85afd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2018$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/3/c83e3f84869c291f33c93bd87bc6df516503d67b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2187$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Then either the number must begin <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/8/ca803a83b741208267b7ae6a39b9bf752753a2ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$221...$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a2cf70a4c4203cca038a267278d1ace8a382e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> with  four more digits at the end\n</p><p>Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/0/420813c47b9ba0edd71bba84716bd485967ac81a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^4$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> options for each so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/6/0961a50e10a302d8e55400dbf45e693118bb43d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+4+8+16+32+64+128-2*16=256-2-32=\\boxed{222}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"495\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Casework.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Casework)\">Solution 3 (Casework)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Casework)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Since the greatest power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> that can be used is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/4/7d440ada8a3f3b7ea6f5beb66cb1834ededc2399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^6$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />, we can do these cases.\n</p><p>Coefficient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/c/2ac9455702507525c0201cd703de35bd6f043c61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^6=0$\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />: Then if the number has only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/c/11ce47412f33e1af05bd0fd1feaca002225ded1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^0$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />, it has 2 choices (1 or 2). Likewise if the number has both a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/e/4ce0583e43880c5a6892f664bd95f9a34b53a5f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^1$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/c/11ce47412f33e1af05bd0fd1feaca002225ded1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^0$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> term, there are 4 choices, and so on until <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef89940c9d0d4b76ae12725c459ab738decd42d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^5$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />, so the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b512f16b2bf3da19a554ac16023af09155f50ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+4+...+64=127-1=126$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"251\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Coefficient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/a/6da151d65b78818a660b6a4d00082faa2ac2442c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^6=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />: Any combination of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for the remaining coefficients works, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/3/c23f7dacd533c95a26bd926214b42d6cc00fb29f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^6=64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />. Why is this less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/b/4bb4795bbf9125d08b3ddc9fbe238166da3bb450.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$126$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />? Because the first time around, leading zeroes didn't count. But this time, all coefficients <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/c/59c404d8a8901ace9c02b39cb10d8dd226134c19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^n$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/c/62cf9c7dd05f5a3c68d04f3c55e0bc34397b835e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&lt;6$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> need 1 and 2.\n</p><p>Coefficient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/a/22a1ee181d300e79dd16ef174e97250d87ed0cbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^6=2$\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />: Look at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef89940c9d0d4b76ae12725c459ab738decd42d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^5$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> coefficient. If 1, all of them work because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/a/21adc4780259a2fd5a87a2e1d078be56669d6db2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^7=2187-3^5=243&lt;&lt;2017$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"242\" height=\"15\" />. That's 32 cases. Now of this coefficient is 2, then at the coefficient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/0/3203d09c2f5928ebd65ffe63c75c70fcfd26315a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^4=81$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> is at least 1. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/3/b93cfa43baeddd314f2d12395b0b519a12dc9dbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^6*2+3^5*2+3^4&gt;&gt;2017$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"221\" height=\"16\" />, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/5/f85c69a19c83933a1d43abb8e73d89a35e932a05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$126+64+32=\\boxed{222}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"171\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_II\" title=\"2017 AIME II\">2017 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2017 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2017 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2017\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2017 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2017 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">